      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. one thing though, you mentioned transfers for the shinkansen from osaka to fukuoka. i thought the line from osaka to hakata was pretty direct? also, if i'm trying to keep things super smooth and avoid any unexpected delays or getting lost in the stations, which one should i prioritize? im not a huge fan of travel chaos.",
